{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>For she is barren</b> — הוא is written, to teach you that he too was barren. And some expound the verse to say: היא and not הוא, for it is written, \"For in Isaac shall seed be called to you\" — inference: he was not barren." "<b>And Rebecca his wife conceived</b> — אשתו in gematria is קש ואש (straw and fire), as in, \"And the house of Jacob shall be fire and the house of Esau straw.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The ketiv הוא (masculine) against the qere היא (feminine) drives both interpretations; the second view cites Genesis 21:12."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:56.656894055Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}